---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Writing
description: Essays by Ali Ganjizadeh on medical AI, data, labels and evaluation.
permalink: /blog/
---
<section class="wrap section">
  <header class="post-header">
    <p class="kicker">Writing</p>
    <h1>Notes on medical AI</h1>
    <p class="dek">On data, labels and evaluation: the parts of medical AI that decide whether a model can be trusted.</p>
  </header>
  <ul class="post-list">
    {%- for post in collections.posts %}
    <li>
      <a href="{{ post.url }}">
        <span class="post-title">{{ post.data.title }}</span>
        <span class="post-dek">{{ post.data.description }}</span>
        <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | longDate }}</time>
      </a>
    </li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
